    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LUNACOVE: REDEFINING FIRST-PERSON MELEE COMBAT</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Be water, my friend.&quot; - Flow like liquid through combat with unprecedented freedom in this revolutionary FPS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Limitless attack possibilities - no preset combos, just pure reactive fighting</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668810/extras/0324691f184a89471360a0d5c1ec7df8.avif?t=1747715584\" data-has-big width=800 height=460 /></span><i></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Lightning-fast melee action</i> meets FPS precision for exhilarating encounters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668810/extras/3ca1e9cbb8ba453208a911b15625b84d.avif?t=1747715584\" data-has-big width=800 height=464 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Seamless movement system lets you dash, slide, and redirect with fluid momentum</i><br>Your fighting style evolves as you master positioning, timing, and weapon techniques</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668810/extras/6bd3d9948e88428b826f1b1b2ac3c3cf.avif?t=1747715584\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LUNACOVE PREVIEW LAUNCHING SOON - WISHLIST NOW!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Lunacove community on <strong>YouTube</strong>, <strong>Twitter</strong>, and <strong>Instagram</strong> for exclusive gameplay footage and be first to know when our crowdfunding campaign goes live!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LUNACOVE: REDEFINING FIRST-PERSON MELEE COMBAT</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Be water, my friend.&quot; - Flow like liquid through combat with unprecedented freedom in this revolutionary FPS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Limitless attack possibilities - no preset combos, just pure reactive fighting</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668810/extras/0324691f184a89471360a0d5c1ec7df8.avif?t=1747715584\" data-has-big width=800 height=460 /></span><i></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Lightning-fast melee action</i> meets FPS precision for exhilarating encounters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668810/extras/3ca1e9cbb8ba453208a911b15625b84d.avif?t=1747715584\" data-has-big width=800 height=464 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Seamless movement system lets you dash, slide, and redirect with fluid momentum</i><br>Your fighting style evolves as you master positioning, timing, and weapon techniques</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668810/extras/6bd3d9948e88428b826f1b1b2ac3c3cf.avif?t=1747715584\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LUNACOVE PREVIEW LAUNCHING SOON - WISHLIST NOW!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Lunacove community on <strong>YouTube</strong>, <strong>Twitter</strong>, and <strong>Instagram</strong> for exclusive gameplay footage and be first to know when our crowdfunding campaign goes live!</p>",
